\ A session ends cleanly however it ends, even if its client is gone before it starts
: dead-conn ( -- conn ) new-conn  sandbox-port over c.lport ! ;
: live ( -- n ) conns @ count-list ;
live .  sandbox-door door.count @ .
dead-conn sandbox-door admit  100 ms
live .  sandbox-door door.count @ .
: dead-clients ( n -- ) 0 ?do dead-conn sandbox-door admit 20 ms loop ;
20 dead-clients  200 ms
live .  sandbox-door door.count @ .  sessions-served @ .
